'''Beet Seeds''' are a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Beet]]s.

They can be purchased at the [[Oasis]] and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by using the [[Seed Maker]].  Five to twenty Beet Seeds may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern.

